WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
Former shopkeeper's house

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,600
The materials used in his home are all fine Nanmu and bricks.

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,640
Just say that there is nothing going on at his house and let’s go check it out.

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:05,640
Let him take us in

5
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,700
Former shopkeeper, what are you doing?

6
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,900
Houses for those of us

7
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,900
All collapsed

8
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,020
It's such a cold day and people are outside at night

9
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,340
It will really freeze to death

10
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,700
Your house is so big

11
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,820
There are so many empty houses

12
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,700
Can you let us in and squeeze in?

13
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,980
Yes, former shopkeeper

14
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,060
Just stay for a few days

15
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,060
Yes, just wait for the snow hall and leave.

16
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,180
Let's go right away

17
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,260
We don't pretend to be diving for nothing. We can do any job.

18
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,020
Can do any job

19
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,460
live in my house

20
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:33,430
Yes Yes

21
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:35,180
Why

22
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,380
My house

23
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:39,370
I spent real money to build it.

24
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:40,650
You bunch of mud-legged people

25
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:41,890
Come in if you say so

26
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:42,970
messed up my yard

27
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:45,490
Who will pay if you step on my floor?

28
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:46,890
But it’s so cold today

29
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:48,290
we have nowhere to go

30
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:49,970
It'll really freeze to death
